        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\n3 BED / 1 BATH FIRST FLOOR HOME\r\nIDYLLIC TRIPLE ASPECT POSITION IN THIS MOST SOUGHT AFTER DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES\r\nADJACENT TO KILMAINHAM, HEUSTON STATION AND THE PHOENIX PARK\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED....\r\n\r\nA lovely home in idyllic setting....\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Dublin 8 Property Specialists are truly delighted to present Apt 60 to the Dublin 8 Property Market.\r\n\r\nBowbridge Place is a most sought after development of homes tucked away in a secluded position yet with every conceivable amenity on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nNo. 60 is sure to impress , investors, first time buyers and parties trading up / down alike.\r\n\r\nThe extra spacious light filled floor plan makes this a perfect city home in a peaceful setting.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan consists of: Entrance hall, living / dining room, kitchen, store room, 3 double bedrooms to include primary and family bathroom. There is also a private balcony off the living room.\r\n\r\nOutside there are private gardens together with secure underground parking.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent with Islandbridge and the Phoenix Park on your doorstep.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe area is further serviced by an excellent bus route making the city centre most accessible. Heuston Station and LUAS stop are also within walking distance.\r\n\r\nThe M50 / M4 Motorways are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address.\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
